// @run
// @log 1
// @warning Unused variable `b` (prefix with `_` to suppress, or remove it)
// The unused-variable warning is DECLARED, not silenced: never reading the field is the
// whole point of this spelling, and the binding has to stay for the interner to see it.
//
// Regression (silent-class-inventory D1008), graduated from
// `error-u8-field-generic-alias-never-read.vl`.
//
// THE WORSE FACE of `u8-field-through-generic-alias.vl`: with the field never READ, the
// mis-interned module VALIDATED. `vl build` exited 0 and wasmtime instantiated it, so
// nothing in the pipeline said a word — which is why this spelling has its own file rather
// than a line in that one.
type Box<T> = { v: T }

const b: Box<u8[]> = { v: [7] }
print(1)
